  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "For example, the hypothesis of scale‐free biology [196] has led to the discovery that individual embryos in large groups form a kind of “hyperembryo” with its own unique transcriptome and an ability to solve teratogenic challenges far better than individual embryos (or small groups) exhibit [197]." ;
